Package: picklerick
Title: Fast Single-Cell Format Conversion via SCX
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("SCX Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "placeholder@example.com")
Description: R bindings to the SCX streaming interop engine for single-cell
    genomics. Converts between H5Seurat, H5AD, and SCX internal formats via
    a memory-bounded streaming pipeline. Inspect file metadata without loading
    data into memory. No Python dependency.
License: GPL-3
Imports:
    methods,
    Matrix,
    jsonlite,
    S4Vectors,
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment
Suggests:
    Seurat,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
SystemRequirements: Cargo (rustup) >= 1.70
